      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your line consists of avekiri who were Passerus members of the Flock of the Song, whose voices were said to be so resonant with magic and divinity they could spread the word of Rahm across the mountains. You bear beautiful and soft plumage, a smaller body but with evocative colorations and bear a melodic voice. You become Trained in Performance and gain the Melodic Chirp action.</span></p>"
